# Speak-ahead (TALKSHOW_SPEAK_AHEAD) against its baseline D, plus a re-check of main:
# D and A repeat arms D and A of latency.arms, so they should land near the earlier
# numbers. D and S come first in case the job is preempted.
# Every arm pins the FIFO hand-raise queue (TALKSHOW_HOST_DECIDE=fifo), as in the October
# runs: the LLM host is the code default and bypasses most of these fixes.
D TALKSHOW_PRERENDER_CANNED=1 TALKSHOW_POLL_DURING_OPEN_FLOOR=1 TALKSHOW_DRAFT_AHEAD=1 TALKSHOW_HOST_DECIDE=fifo
S TALKSHOW_PRERENDER_CANNED=1 TALKSHOW_POLL_DURING_OPEN_FLOOR=1 TALKSHOW_DRAFT_AHEAD=1 TALKSHOW_SPEAK_AHEAD=1 TALKSHOW_HOST_DECIDE=fifo
A TALKSHOW_HOST_DECIDE=fifo
